# DESK36 -- the four cases the ticket names, in one gesture.
#
# Press on HELLO.TXT (a plain file) and drag it, without releasing, over
#   C_OVER_PROG    QED.NAP      an installed application  -> must invert
#   D_OVER_FOLDER  SUB          a folder                  -> must invert
#   E_OVER_FILE    README.TXT   a plain file              -> must NOT invert
#   F_OVER_TRASH   the trash    a desktop icon            -> must invert
# then back onto the source item and release (a self-drop, which EmuTOS
# cancels, `deskact.c:666-670`) so the run writes nothing to the card:
#   G_BACK         over the source, still held
#   H_RELEASED     released -- the highlight must be gone everywhere
#
# Coordinates from d-probe: window 1 items HELLO.TXT (347,187),
# QED.NAP (179,271), SUB (515,103), README.TXT (347,271); desktop trash
# (38,449).
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1500 move 37 42
1700 down
1703 up
1710 down
1713 up
2300 move 600 240
3000 mark B_WIN1
3400 move 347 187
3700 down
3800 drag 179 271
4100 mark C_OVER_PROG
4700 drag 515 103
5000 mark D_OVER_FOLDER
5600 drag 347 271
5900 mark E_OVER_FILE
6500 drag 38 449
6800 mark F_OVER_TRASH
7400 drag 347 187
7700 mark G_BACK
8300 up
8500 move 600 240
9200 mark H_RELEASED
